      "id": "claim_e41c29edde844c368f6843e280c71bb1",
      "statement": "ArDoCo REST builds as io.github.ardoco:rest:2.1.0-SNAPSHOT on the io.github.ardoco:parent:2.1.0 parent POM; Spring Boot is managed by importing the spring-boot-dependencies 4.1.1 BOM into dependencyManagement, and the spring-boot-maven-plugin repackages the executable jar with main class edu.kit.kastel.mcse.ardoco.tlr.rest.ArDoCoRestApplication while the Failsafe plugin binds integration-test and verify to the integration-test phase.",
